3
00:00:11.436 --> 00:00:17.971
Your visa status determines what you can and cannot do in your own company, talk to an immigration attorney early.

4
00:00:17.971 --> 00:00:22.219
Plan for total employment cost at roughly 1.15 to 1.30 times base salary.

5
